[node name="NPCMenu" parent="NPC/NPCArea" unique_id=1682255154 instance=ExtResource("10_l7n68")]
Messages = Array[String](["I see you have arrived in good time, the portal that was opened to you has brought you to the appropriate place.", "\"Are you the magic weilder?\"", "Unfortunately he is not here, he had other buisness to attend to and I am merely his apprentice. A goblin that took the path of magic, a taboo of my species.", "However, he opened a gate on the other side of this field to bring you closer to him, however he left me with some instruction.", "He said that the gateway there will take you to a man named \"The Doctor\". He resides in the most trecherous of places but he is very knowledgeable.", "Oh, and for this area you are currently in you must be careful, if you do not have a sword or a good pair of legs you will surely be overtaken by slimes, lower beings who attack anything in sight and their regenerative capabilities make them difficult to defeat. If you find yourself wounded from battle there are several vegetables on the grounds of this field. Feel free to stock up. Good luck."])

